          "en": "to a more complex scenario that we could test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.93,
          "end": 9.63,
          "en": "a more complex component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.63,
          "end": 12.84,
          "en": "I added this new async component,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 12.84,
          "end": 15.77,
          "en": "and you find that component also attached.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 15.77,
          "end": 19.64,
          "en": "And the component itself is not that complex.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 19.64,
          "end": 22.9,
          "en": "It uses state and it uses use effect.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 22.9,
          "end": 24.99,
          "en": "So that in use effect,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 24.99,
          "end": 28.25,
          "en": "we send the HTTP request to this dummy API",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 28.25,
          "end": 31.13,
          "en": "to fetch some dummy posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.13,
          "end": 34.93,
          "en": "And then these posts are set as state here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.93,
          "end": 38.223,
          "en": "and they are rendered out as a list down there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 39.34,
          "end": 42.32,
          "en": "Now, if you would start this development server,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.32,
          "end": 43.83,
          "en": "you would see something like this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 43.83,
          "end": 45.47,
          "en": "because I don't have any styling",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 45.47,
          "end": 48.21,
          "en": "since this is not about the styling at all,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 48.21,
          "end": 51.51,
          "en": "but you see that fetching and rendering these dummy posts",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 51.51,
          "end": 56.313,
          "en": "from this dummy API, JSON placeholder works.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 57.59,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "Now, that works and here we are, of course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 63.23,
          "en": "using some core mechanisms we learned about in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 63.23,
          "end": 66.593,
          "en": "especially use effect for side effects like this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 67.87,
          "end": 71.07,
          "en": "Now we wanna write tests for this component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 71.07,
          "end": 73.25,
          "en": "because, of course, this is also something",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 73.25,
          "end": 75.33,
          "en": "which we typically wanna test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 75.33,
          "end": 79.453,
          "en": "and there will be a couple of complexities related to that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.61,
          "end": 83.82,
          "en": "Now, for that, let's first of all, add a new file,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 83.82,
          "end": 87.68,
          "en": "async test.js sounds like a fitting name.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 87.68,
          "end": 92.68,
          "en": "And in there, my tests failed because I have no tests yet.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.87,
          "end": 97.09,
          "en": "I'll add a new test suite, and I'll name it async component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.83,
          "end": 100.61,
          "en": "To have that as a wrapper.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 100.61,
          "end": 104.343,
          "en": "And then in here we can write the actual test code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 105.69,
          "end": 109.82,
          "en": "Now, I will import the render and screen function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 109.82,
          "end": 111.22999999999999,
          "en": "from the testing library.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 111.22999999999999,
          "end": 114.69,
          "en": "So I'll grab that import and add that here as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 114.69,
          "end": 116.81,
          "en": "And then we wanna create a test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.81,
          "end": 118.88,
          "en": "we wanna write a test where we test",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 118.88,
          "end": 121.94,
          "en": "whether the posts are being rendered correctly.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.94,
          "end": 124.703,
          "en": "That could be the first test, which you wanna write.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 126.4,
          "end": 130.8,
          "en": "So here I'll say renders posts, that's my test,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 130.8,
          "end": 134.763,
          "en": "or renders posts if request succeeds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 136.52,
          "end": 139.42000000000002,
          "en": "And then here, this is our testing code.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 139.42000000000002,
          "end": 144.42000000000002,
          "en": "We now, of course, wanna render this async component.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 145.25,
          "end": 148.64,
          "en": "So we should import this async component",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 148.64,
          "end": 152.39,
          "en": "from this async file here and render it.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 152.39,
          "end": 155.303,
          "en": "That's our arrange step.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 156.18,
          "end": 158.34,
          "en": "Then we don't really need to act",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 158.34,
          "end": 161.54,
          "en": "because rendering it is already everything I wanna do,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 161.54,
          "end": 165.54,
          "en": "since we will then fetch and set posts automatically",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 165.54,
          "end": 167.36,
          "en": "because of user fact.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 167.36,
          "end": 169.35,
          "en": "So no other step is required.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 169.35,
          "end": 172.52,
          "en": "And therefore we can now dive into the assertion.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 172.52,
          "end": 177.31,
          "en": "And for that, I wanna check if some list items were rendered",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 177.31,
          "end": 180.39,
          "en": "because I noted if list items were rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 180.39,
          "end": 183.14,
          "en": "posts were fetched correctly because otherwise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 183.14,
          "end": 185.243,
          "en": "no list items would have been rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 186.72,
          "end": 189.29,
          "en": "So therefore, we can reach out to our screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 189.29,
          "end": 192.81,
          "en": "And now we'll find out if list items were rendered.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 192.81,
          "end": 195.32,
          "en": "And there are various ways of getting access.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 195.32,
          "end": 198.96,
          "en": "Here, I wanna get access by role",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 198.96,
          "end": 202.48,
          "en": "because getting access by role will allow me to find out",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 202.48,
          "end": 204.82,
          "en": "if there are list items on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 204.82,
          "end": 209.773,
          "en": "since list item is a role HTML elements can assume.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 210.78,
          "end": 213.73,
          "en": "To find out about all supported roles,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 213.73,
          "end": 216.963,
          "en": "I also attached a link with more information on that.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 218.21,
          "end": 220.76,
          "en": "So here we could use get by role.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 220.76,
          "end": 224.25,
          "en": "However, since I expect to actually",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 224.25,
          "end": 229.25,
          "en": "have multiple list items, we should use get all by role,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 229.92000000000002,
          "end": 232.69,
          "en": "because get by role would fail",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 232.69,
          "end": 237.38,
          "en": "if we have more than one item with that specified role.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 237.38,
          "end": 240.35,
          "en": "So here I wanna get all by role.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 240.35,
          "end": 243.57,
          "en": "And then the role here is list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 243.57,
          "end": 246.883,
          "en": "You find that role in that attached document.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 248.64,
          "end": 252.49,
          "en": "So that's the role by which I wanna select items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 252.49,
          "end": 257.49,
          "en": "And therefore here, I hopefully have my list item elements",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 257.63,
          "end": 261.63,
          "en": "which will be an array of HTML elements.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 261.63,
          "end": 265.903,
          "en": "And the expectation now would be that list item elements,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 266.83,
          "end": 269.28,
          "en": "this array is not empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 269.28,
          "end": 271.82,
          "en": "because if this array of items is empty,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 271.82,
          "end": 274.48,
          "en": "we know that no items were rendered,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 274.48,
          "end": 277.123,
          "en": "and that of course is not the desired result.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 278.09000000000003,
          "end": 282.67,
          "en": "So here I wanna check that this is not empty",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 282.67,
          "end": 286.413,
          "en": "so that it does not have a length of zero.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 287.42,
          "end": 291.01,
          "en": "Two half length allows us to check the length of an array,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 291.01,
          "end": 292.546,
          "en": "and here I only care",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 292.546,
          "end": 296.23,
          "en": "about the fact that the length is not zero,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 296.23,
          "end": 298.573,
          "en": "so this is therefore my expectation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 299.42,
          "end": 303.14,
          "en": "And you will typically be able to express your expectation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 303.14,
          "end": 305.67,
          "en": "with different combinations here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 305.67,
          "end": 308.823,
          "en": "I'm going for this expectation here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 310.3,
          "end": 313.61,
          "en": "Now, if I saved this and my tests run, however,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 313.61,
          "end": 316.58,
          "en": "you will see that this fails.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 316.58,
          "end": 318.37,
          "en": "You see that this fails",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 318.37,
          "end": 321.2,
          "en": "because we're unable to find an accessible element",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 321.2,
          "end": 322.783,
          "en": "with the role, list item.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 323.74,
          "end": 327.51,
          "en": "So somehow it fails to get list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 327.51,
          "end": 329.65,
          "en": "And to understand this error,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 329.65,
          "end": 334.45,
          "en": "it is important to understand that get all by role,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 98,
          "start": 334.45,
          "end": 339.45,
          "en": "just like the query methods you have here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 99,
          "start": 339.74,
          "end": 343.803,
          "en": "will instantly look for these elements on the screen.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 100,
          "start": 344.78,
          "end": 348.61,
          "en": "But keep in mind that here we are sending an HTTP request,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 101,
          "start": 348.61,
          "end": 351.67,
          "en": "which is an asynchronous action.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 102,
          "start": 351.67,
          "end": 355,
          "en": "So therefore the posts are not there immediately.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 103,
          "start": 355,
          "end": 357.11,
          "en": "Instead, this component renders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 104,
          "start": 357.11,
          "end": 360.2,
          "en": "and initially it renders with an empty array here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 105,
          "start": 360.2,
          "end": 361.95,
          "en": "with an empty array of posts.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 106,
          "start": 361.95,
          "end": 365.163,
          "en": "So therefore initially, there are no list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 107,
          "start": 366.15,
          "end": 369,
          "en": "Then after this first render cycle,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 108,
          "start": 369,
          "end": 371.04,
          "en": "this effect immediately runs.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 109,
          "start": 371.04,
          "end": 372.95,
          "en": "And then this request is sent.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 110,
          "start": 372.95,
          "end": 375.82,
          "en": "And once the response is there, the state is updated,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 111,
          "start": 375.82,
          "end": 378.52,
          "en": "and then this component re-renders,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 112,
          "start": 378.52,
          "end": 381.053,
          "en": "this time with list items.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 113,
          "start": 381.91,
          "end": 385.29,
          "en": "But the initial render cycle does not have list items",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 114,
          "start": 385.29,
          "end": 387.48,
          "en": "because there are no posts initially,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 115,
          "start": 387.48,
          "end": 389.37,
          "en": "because fetching that post data",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 116,
          "start": 389.37,
          "end": 391.923,
          "en": "takes a couple of milliseconds or seconds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 117,
          "start": 393.28,
          "end": 394.85,
          "en": "And that's our problem here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 118,
          "start": 394.85,
          "end": 396.40999999999997,
          "en": "With get all by role,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 119,
          "start": 396.40999999999997,
          "end": 399.59000000000003,
          "en": "we immediately get all these items on the screen,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 120,
          "start": 399.59000000000003,
          "end": 401.04,
          "en": "and initially there are none.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 121,
          "start": 402.35,
          "end": 404.57,
          "en": "Now, there is a simple work around, though.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 122,
          "start": 404.57,
          "end": 409.223,
          "en": "Instead of get all by role, you can use find all by role.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 123,
          "start": 410.15999999999997,
          "end": 414.69,
          "en": "The difference is that find all by role or in general,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 124,
          "start": 414.69,
          "end": 417.15999999999997,
          "en": "those find queries which you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 125,
          "start": 417.15999999999997,
          "end": 422.16,
          "en": "instead of the get queries, these queries return a promise.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 126,
          "start": 422.72,
          "end": 424.97,
          "en": "Here you get back a promise,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 127,
          "start": 424.97,
          "end": 427.81,
          "en": "and actually react testing library",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 128,
          "start": 427.81,
          "end": 431.61,
          "en": "will basically reevaluate the screen",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 129,
          "start": 431.61,
          "end": 435.23,
          "en": "a couple of times until this succeeds.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 130,
          "start": 435.23,
          "end": 438.576,
          "en": "So therefore now, this will then wait for this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 131,
          "start": 438.576,
          "end": 440.58299999999997,
          "en": "HTTP request to succeed.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 132,
          "start": 442.12,
          "end": 446.67,
          "en": "For find all by role, you can also specify a third argument.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 133,
          "start": 446.67,
          "end": 449.88,
          "en": "The second argument allows you to set exact and so on.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 134,
          "start": 449.88,
          "end": 452.29,
          "en": "The third argument is another object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 135,
          "start": 452.29,
          "end": 454.89300000000003,
